{"1274700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "You Alone Can Defeat Evil", "steam_appid": 1274700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274700/extras/e32fced1a5913aa6014ec95f85cb7223.avif?t=1781697252\" width=1500 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>You Alone Can Defeat Evil</strong></i> is a skill-intensive action challenge built around one relentless boss fight: <strong>the Great Demon</strong>. Every death is a lesson. Every attempt brings you closer to mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a rogue sorcerer — an outcast of the Order of Eskilon — and face a foe designed to test your patience, precision, and resolve. This is not a battle of chance, but of learning, adaptation, and execution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with forbidden magic and bound by cursed tattoos, each attempt becomes a fight for survival. Death is inevitable, but never meaningless. Every defeat unlocks new powers, reveals hidden lore, and gives you another chance to refine your strategy and overcome the impossible.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274700/extras/77648ceae17dd41ff08f774706002234.avif?t=1781697252\" width=1500 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274700/extras/e7bb6c140a1d7a7972138f4be7c1bdd9.poster.avif?t=1781697252\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274700/extras/e7bb6c140a1d7a7972138f4be7c1bdd9.webm?t=1781697252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274700/extras/e7bb6c140a1d7a7972138f4be7c1bdd9.mp4?t=1781697252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274700/extras/657e22406468aa3f116fa24d8f71f06d.avif?t=1781697252\" width=1500 height=250 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the Great Demon!</strong><br>Enter a relentless boss fight where every move counts and only mastery will decide your fate.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash Forbidden Magic!</strong><br>Harness soul-twisting tattoos that grant new powers and let you forge your own combat style.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move Like a Shadow!</strong><br>Dodge, weave, and strike in a fluid movement-based combat system built for precision and speed.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Die to Grow Stronger!</strong><br>Each death etches a new tattoo into your flesh, reviving you stronger, wiser, and closer to victory.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover Hidden Lore!</strong><br>Earn mystical lore books that reveal lost histories of Eskilon while gifting you new magical powers.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Dark Secrets!</strong><br>Unveil hidden mechanics and mysterious elements that extend beyond the single-player experience.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test Your Limits!</strong><br>With its punishing difficulty and skill-focused design, YACDE is crafted for players who crave a true challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274700/extras/894adb910b665806ab0187ce7526d38e.poster.avif?t=1781697252\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274700/extras/894adb910b665806ab0187ce7526d38e.webm?t=1781697252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274700/extras/894adb910b665806ab0187ce7526d38e.mp4?t=1781697252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you defeat the Great Demon? Or will you be just another forgotten soul in the ruins of Eskilon?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is not a game about victory on the first try.</strong><br>It is a game about persistence, growth, and earning every inch of progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Great Demon will not wait.<br>He will not go easy.<br>And he will not forgive mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274700/extras/3fb9bebb1ec6d5aa042065faeab14b21.poster.avif?t=1781697252\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274700/extras/3fb9bebb1ec6d5aa042065faeab14b21.webm?t=1781697252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274700/extras/3fb9bebb1ec6d5aa042065faeab14b21.mp4?t=1781697252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But with enough skill, patience, and determination…<br><strong>you alone can defeat evil.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as